s://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-7rdvy-lzffd9jbmm98b6', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F554629856%2F23793120391', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
